yle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)생 학적 수정사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 꼭 확인하여 주시고, 변경사항이 있을 시 수정하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;1. 학적사항 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">『원스톱 → 학적부 → 학적자료조회』에서 내용 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2. 학적사항 수정 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">『원스톱 → 학적부 → 학적부기재변경』에서 수정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(수정사항은 본인의 변경된 연락처, 주소 및 이메일 등 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수시 변경 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;3. 사진 등록 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학적부 사진 등재는 학생증 발급 및 각종 학사업무 지원을 받을 수 있음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 사진 제출</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 이메일(sjajpg@kumoh.ac.kr)발송 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ jpg 이미지 파일을 학번과 성명을 표기하여 이메일로 발송</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직접방문 및&nbsp; 우편송부</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 주소 : 730-701 경북 구미시&nbsp;대학로 61</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 대학원지원팀(본관302호)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;※ 학적부사진 미제출시 주의사항</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>학적부사진을 미제출한 학생은 원스톱서비스 사용 제한 및 학사관련 업무</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(수강신청, 휴학신청, 성적확인 등 ) 불가</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">☆</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">본인의 학적사항을 수시로 확인하여 변경되는 즉시 관련 내용을 수정해 주시기 바랍니다</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2012.&nbsp;&nbsp; 7.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅대학원)장</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"13\" valign=\"center\" width=\"642\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
